OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 15, sexually assaulted in
OL,4,AAberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating the sexual
OL,7,Fassault of a 15-year-old girl in
OL,8,FAberdeen.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the Gardner
OL,11,FRoad area of the city at about 01:00 on
OL,12,FSunday morning.
OL,14,FPolice remain at the scene.
OL,16,FOfficers are urging anyone with
OL,17,Finformation to contact Police Scotland.
